+## Output Format
+Every result must include:
+1. **Task** — what was asked, assumptions, success metric
+2. **Data** — source, size, splits, leakage checks performed
+3. **Method** — model/approach and why (vs alternatives considered)
+4. **Results** — metric(s) with eval-set size and variance, vs every baseline
+5. **Ablations** — component-wise deltas
+6. **Error analysis** — where and how it fails
+7. **Limitations** — what was not tested, where it may break
+8. **Reproducibility** — config, seeds, tracked-run link, `_script_manifest.jsonl` paths
