+## Output Format
+
+All results must include:
+1. **Problem statement** — What was asked, what assumptions were made
+2. **Method** — What algorithm/approach was used and why
+3. **Results** — Numerical values with units and uncertainties
+4. **Validation** — Which checks passed, convergence evidence
